Notice for the code ported from xsf's include/xsf/cpu/specfun/specfun.h
(chgm, cgama, gamma2, psi_spec, lpmv, lpmv0 in src/xsf/specfun.rs) and from
include/xsf/cpu/legendre.h (lqn, lqmn, after Zhang and Jin's LQNA and LQMNA in
src/xsf/legendre.rs).

xsf's specfun.h is SciPy's C++ translation of the Fortran code of Shanjie Zhang
and Jianming Jin, "Computation of Special Functions" (Wiley, 1996). The header
below is that file's own, kept verbatim from xsf at commit
31177fd9a458539cf05c04d215341245d0245e53. Zhang and Jin's code is "Copyrighted
but permission granted to use code in programs"; SciPy's translation is
distributed under the 3-clause BSD license of xsf (LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-xsf in
this directory, Copyright (C) 2024 SciPy developers), which is the license the
header ends with.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
